WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:08.670
Bernie Sanders has formally endorsed presumptive
Democratic presidential candidate Joe Biden

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:12.450
and has directed his supporters to vote for
Joe in November.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.559
Now, Bernie Sanders suspended his campaign
last week.

00:00:15.559 --> 00:00:20.050
It became clear that he had no mathematical
path to the nomination.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:23.890
And Bernie now is telling his supporters,
you've got to vote for Joe.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:28.300
Here is Bernie himself issuing the endorsement
during a call yesterday.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.950
I'm feeling so today.

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:36.960
I am asking all Americans, I'm asking every
Democrat, I'm asking every independent.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:43.610
I'm asking a lot of Republicans to come together
in this campaign to support your candidacy,

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:52.539
which I endorse, to make certain that we defeat
somebody who I believe from speaking just

00:00:52.539 --> 00:00:59.489
for myself now is the most dangerous president
in the modern history of this country.

00:00:59.489 --> 00:01:02.420
Very important step for Bernie to be taking.

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:04.059
Noam Chomsky agrees.

00:01:04.059 --> 00:01:12.080
This is not you know, the importance of removing
Trump is not a centrist idea.

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:15.530
Prominent progressives, prominent leftists
are making this clear.

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:18.420
Here's Noam Chomsky recently on Democracy
Now!

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:21.820
If Trump is reelected.

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:24.090
It's.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:26.280
Indescribable disaster.

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:34.270
It means that the policies of the past four
years, which are an extremely destructive

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:44.090
to the American population, to the world,
will be continued and probably accelerated.

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:48.890
The way this is gonna mean for health is bad
enough.

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:53.920
I just mentioned the loss of triggers that
will get worse.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:02:00.390
What this means for the environment or the
threat of nuclear war, which no one is talking

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:03.020
about, is extremely serious.

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:06.320
Who's been described as POWs?

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:11.620
Biden has worked in a mine.

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:16.720
I would anticipate it would be essentially
a continuation of Obama.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:19.319
Think great.

00:02:19.319 --> 00:02:29.930
At least not totally destructive on opportunities
for an organized public to change what is

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:30.959
being done.

00:02:30.959 --> 00:02:31.959
So this is it.

00:02:31.959 --> 00:02:35.329
I mean, listen, I'm with Bernie and I'm with
no chant.

00:02:35.329 --> 00:02:36.359
Noam Chomsky on this.

00:02:36.359 --> 00:02:37.879
I'm voting for Joe Biden.

00:02:37.879 --> 00:02:42.920
And I don't have that much more to add at
this point, because you all know, I've been

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:45.269
laying the case out for a long time.

00:02:45.269 --> 00:02:49.139
I am not about vote blue no matter who I am,
not even a Democrat.

00:02:49.139 --> 00:02:52.110
I'm about evaluating the choices that we have.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:57.389
And either Donald Trump will be reelected
in November or Joe Biden will defeat Donald

00:02:57.389 --> 00:03:01.079
Trump and will replace him as president of
the United States.

00:03:01.079 --> 00:03:03.029
I'm with Biden on that.

00:03:03.029 --> 00:03:10.090
And anyone who has seen how Corona virus has
reduced Trump to even more of a dangerously

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:15.450
petulant child yesterday going full authoritarian
during the White House coronavirus press briefing.

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:17.549
I'll have that for you a little bit later.

00:03:17.549 --> 00:03:23.909
I can not take any action that will facilitate
Trump getting another four years in good conscience.

00:03:23.909 --> 00:03:28.540
Now, I know that you can create these arguments
where you say you don't have to vote, right.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:32.529
I mean, you can just you can choose not you
can say, I don't like either option and I'm

00:03:32.529 --> 00:03:35.030
not voting even if I like one option.

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:36.809
Not exactly the same as the other.

00:03:36.809 --> 00:03:38.419
I can still say I'm not voting.

00:03:38.419 --> 00:03:39.419
That's totally fine.

00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:42.340
And I'm not going to go and attack people
who are doing that.

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:47.819
But you have to understand that on a practical
level, you are acting in a way that gives

00:03:47.819 --> 00:03:53.469
makes Donald Trump get one vote closer to
reelection and another four years.

00:03:53.469 --> 00:03:55.569
This from Bernie is simply Bernie.

00:03:55.569 --> 00:03:58.840
Recognizing that winning is the most important
thing in November.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:03.629
That's how weaponised Trump's delusions and
ignorance and incompetence are.

00:04:03.629 --> 00:04:07.370
Removing Trump is the most important thing
in November.

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:12.519
If Bernie supporters truly trust him, they
should do what Bernie has determined is the

00:04:12.519 --> 00:04:13.909
correct path.

00:04:13.909 --> 00:04:19.280
This should undermine, by the way, the narrative
from some who are saying Bernie's trying to

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:21.220
hurt Joe Biden's campaign.

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:22.840
Bernie got out last week.

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:26.040
Bernie is unequivocally endorsing Joe Biden
now.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.040
Period.

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:31.800
Now, there will be some Bernie or Busters
who say, I don't care about Bernie's endorsement.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:34.300
I was never about Bernie as an individual.

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:37.120
I was about Bernie in terms of his policies.

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:38.120
Fine.

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:40.070
There are two people running right now.

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:43.350
It is very clear whose policies are closer
to those of Bernie Sanders.

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:44.900
And it's not Trump.

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:50.260
So how do you in good conscience act in a
way that reinforces Trump getting another

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:51.260
four years?

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:53.730
It could be by voting or it could be by not
voting.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:59.100
Either way, you have a role to play, and the
idea of not voting as neutral needs to be

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:03.560
tied up in a doggy bag and put in the trash
can.

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:04.910
Not someone else's trash can.

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:07.410
Some people have done in my driveway, but
your own trash can.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.710
But I think you understand the analogy.

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:12.460
Biden and Bernie both want a $15 minimum wage.

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:13.780
Biden and.

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:16.540
Bernie both want back into the Paris climate
deal.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.690
Both want universal gun background checks.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:20.000
Both are for abortion rights.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.310
Both are for higher taxes on capital gains.

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:23.790
Both are for paid family leave.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:26.140
Both are for citizenship for DACA recipients.

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:27.910
And I can go on and on.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.310
Biden's not for Medicare for all.

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:30.310
That's true.

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:34.780
He's for lower lowering Medicare to 60 plus
and adding a public option that would give

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:40.260
20 million more people access to Medicare
and it would lower premiums 8 to 9 percent

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:41.380
for everybody else.

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:44.190
Bernie likely wasn't going to get more than
that.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:48.430
And I know many of you hate me for saying
that, but that's the reality.

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:53.640
So the question is, how does Biden compare
to Trump?

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:56.420
It's night and day on every single one of
those issues.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:57.910
So I can't control everything.

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:02.530
I have no interest in fighting with people
or telling people that they're bad people

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:03.530
or any of that.

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:08.170
I can control my vote in November and I can
control communicating to you.

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.170
Why?

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:10.170
That's my vote.

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:13.690
I'm glad to see Bernie Sanders endorse Joe
Biden.

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:17.000
And I think most of us understand what we
have to do.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:23.500
If you have 15 seconds, please take a three
questions survey at David.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.630
CNN.com slash survey.

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:31.890
We're trying to see how our how our audience
is affected by Corona virus.

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:36.630
So if you have just 15 seconds, please take
the three questions survey at David Pakman

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:38.620
dot com slash survey.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:39.730
Totally anonymous.

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:42.890
Three questions takes 15 seconds, maybe 10
of the seconds.

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:45.280
We'll be just pulling up the Web site.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:49.190
And I'm going to have anonymized results for
you coming up soon.

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:50.990
Let me know on Twitter.

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:54.330
What does Bernie's endorsement of Biden do
for you?

00:06:54.330 --> 00:08:46.360
I'm Dean Pacman

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:52.899
on Twitter.

